 line-clamp-2 leading-snug\">Here’s the screen you never want to see: One UI 9 permalocking your phone</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-base-content/60 line-clamp-3\">Saving your curiosity from having to try this on your own phone.</p><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mt-2 text-sm text-base-content/50\"><span class=\"font-medium\">Android Authority</span><time dateTime=\"2026-07-31\">Yesterday</time></div></div></a><a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/gadgets/973973/apple-airtag-second-generation-deal-sale\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" class=\"card bg-base-200 border border-base-300 hover:border-primary transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 duration-200\"><figure class=\"relative aspect-video overflow-hidden bg-base-300\"><img src=\"https://picsum.photos/seed/13012/600/340\" alt=\"Apple’s new AirTags are back down to their best price\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover\" loading=\"lazy\"/><span class=\"absolute top-2 left-2 badge badge-md badge-primary\">cameras</span></figure><div class=\"card-body p-4 gap-2\"><h3 class=\"text-base font-semibold line-clamp-2 leading-snug\">Apple’s new AirTags are back down to their best price</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-base-content/60 line-clamp-3\">Both Amazon and Costco are offering some solid deals. | Photo by Amelia Holowaty Krales / The Verge We spotted a great deal on Tile trackers earlier this week that’s still live, but if you’re an iPhon</p><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mt-2 text-sm text-base-content/50\"><span class=\"font-medium\">The Verge</span><time dateTime=\"2026-07-31\">Yesterday</time></div></div></a><a href=\"https://9to5google.com/2026/07/31/pixelated-110-androids-past-present-and-future/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" class=\"card bg-base-200 border border-base-300 hover:border-primary transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 duration-200\"><figure class=\"relative aspect-video overflow-hidden bg-base-300\"><img src=\"https://picsum.photos/seed/12632/600/340\" al