3943/google-earth-ai-image-generation-deepfake-tool\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" class=\"card bg-base-200 border border-base-300 hover:border-primary transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 duration-200\"><figure class=\"relative aspect-video overflow-hidden bg-base-300\"><img src=\"https://picsum.photos/seed/4950/600/340\" alt=\"Google Earth&amp;#8217;s AI deepfake tool only lasted one day\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover\" loading=\"lazy\"/><span class=\"absolute top-2 left-2 badge badge-md badge-primary\">tech</span></figure><div class=\"card-body p-4 gap-2\"><h3 class=\"text-base font-semibold line-clamp-2 leading-snug\">Google Earth&amp;#8217;s AI deepfake tool only lasted one day</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-base-content/60 line-clamp-3\">Pompeii reimagined with Nano Banana 2 in Google Earth. | Image: Google Google has shut down Google Earth feature it launched Thursday that allowed users to edit satellite images with text prompts usin</p><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mt-2 text-sm text-base-content/50\"><span class=\"font-medium\">The Verge</span><time dateTime=\"2026-07-31\">Yesterday</time></div></div></a><a href=\"https://arstechnica.com/culture/2026/07/ai-startup-admits-tattoo-for-interview-stunt-was-reckless/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" class=\"card bg-base-200 border border-base-300 hover:border-primary transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 duration-200\"><figure class=\"relative aspect-video overflow-hidden bg-base-300\"><img src=\"https://picsum.photos/seed/6528/600/340\" alt=\"Would you get tattooed just to interview at a 7-days-a-week AI startup?\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover\" loading=\"lazy\"/><span class=\"absolute top-2 left-2 badge badge-md badge-primary\">auto</span></figure><div class=\"card-body p-4 gap-2\"><h3 class=\"text-base font-semibold line-clamp-2 leading-snug\">Would you get tattooed just to interview at a 7-days-a-week AI startup?</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-base-content/60 line-clamp-3\">LemonLime’s CEO got “carried away” with tattoo gimmick.</p><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mt-2 text-sm text-base-content/50\"><span class=\"font-medium\">Ars Technica</span><time dateTime=\"2026-07-31\">Yesterday</time></div></div></a><a href=\"https://www.techradar.com/gaming/weve-set-this-company-up-in-preparation-for-this-moment-as-playstation-scraps-discs-these-companies-are-ready-to-keep-physical-games-alive\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" class=\"card bg-base-200 border border-base-300 hover:border-primary transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 duration-200\"><figure class=\"relative aspect-video overflow-hidden bg-base-300\"><img src=\"https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/jVd4K9x4hGSFUZBhmBTWrU-1280-80.jpg\" alt=\"&#x27;We&#x27;ve set this company up in preparation for this moment&#x27; — as PlayStation scraps discs, these companies are ready to keep physical games alive\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover\" loading=\"lazy\"/><span class=\"absolute top-2 left-2 badge badge-md badge-primary\">electronics</span></figure><div class=\"card-body p-4 gap-2\"><h3 class=\"text-base font-semibold line-clamp-2 leading-snug\">&#x27;We&#x27;ve set this company up in preparation for this moment&#x27; — as PlayStation scraps discs, these companies are ready to keep physical games alive</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-base-content/60 line-clamp-3\">I spoke to some of the companies keeping physical games media alive in the wake of PlayStation&#x27;s pivot to a digital-only future, and what they&#x27;re continuing to do to provide fans with the experience t</p><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mt-2 text-sm text-base-content/50\"><span class=\"font-medium\">TechRadar</span><time dateTime=\"2026-07-31\">Yesterday</time></div></div></a><a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/transportation/973887/nhtsa-tesla-investigation-suspension\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" class=\"card bg-base-200 border border-base-300 hover:border-primary transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 duration-200\"><figure class=\"relative aspect-video overflow-hidden bg-base-300\"><img src=\"https://picsum.photos/seed/7986/600/340\" alt=\"The NHTSA is investigating 1.2 million Tesla vehicles over suspension failure reports\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover\" loading=\"lazy\"/><span class=\"absolute top-2 left-2 badge badge-md badge-primary\">auto</span></figure><div class=\"card-body p-4 gap-2\"><h3 class=\"text-base font-semibold line-clamp-2 leading-snug\">The NHTSA is investigating 1.2 million Tesla vehicles over suspension failure reports</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-base-content/60 line-clamp-3\">The National Highway Traffic Safety Administration (NHTSA) is probing nearly 1.2 million Tesla vehicles after receiving complaints about a suspension failure that could cause &quot;a loss of vehicle direct</p><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mt-2 text-sm text-base-content/50\"><span class=\"font-medium\">The Verge</span><time dateTime=\"2026-07-31\">Yesterday</time></div></div></a><a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/tech/973889/google-pixel-tag-item-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" class=\"card bg-base-200 border border-base-300 hover:border-primary transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 duration-200\"><figure class=\"relative aspect-video overflow-hidden bg-base-300\"><img src=\"https://picsum.photos/seed/19265/600/340\" alt=\"Google might launch a ‘Pixel Tag’\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover\" loading=\"lazy\"/><span class=\"absolute top-2 left-2 badge badge-md badge-primary\">mobiles</span></figure><div class=\"card-body p-4 gap-2\"><h3 class=\"text-base font-semibold line-clamp-2 leading-snug\">Google might launch a ‘Pixel Tag’</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-base-content/60 line-clamp-3\">Google is seemingly working on an item tracker that might compete with Apple&#x27;s AirTag. 9to5Google obtained an image of something called a &quot;Google Pixel Tag&quot; that has a small oval shape. The publicatio</p><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mt-2 text-sm text-base-content/50\"><span class=\"font-medium\">The Verge</span><time dateTime=\"2026-07-31\">Yesterday</time></div></div></a><a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/07/31/report-apple-hit-a-record-49-share-of-global-smartphone-revenue-for-q2/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" class=\"card bg-base-200 border border-base-300 hover:border-primary transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 duration-200\"><figure class=\"relative aspect-video overflow-hidden bg-base-300\"><img src=\"https://picsum.photos/seed/6461/600/340\" alt=\"Report: Apple hit a record 49% share of global smartphone revenue for Q2\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover\" loading=\"lazy\"/><span class=\"absolute top-2 left-2 badge badge-md badge-primary\">mobiles</span></figure><div class=\"card-body p-4 gap-2\"><h3 class=\"text-base font-semibold line-clamp-2 leading-snug\">Report: Apple hit a record 49% share of global smartphone revenue for Q2</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-base-content/60 line-clamp-3\">According to Counterpoint Research, Apple captured nearly half of global smartphone revenue during the second quarter, despite a market-wide decline in shipments. Here are the details.</p><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mt-2 text-sm text-base-content/50\"><span class=\"font-medium\">9to5Mac</span><time dateTime=\"2026-07-31\">Yesterday</time></div></div></a><a href=\"https://www.androidauthority.com/pixel-glow-hilight-name-3693448/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" class=\"card bg-base-200 border border-base-300 hover:border-primary transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 duration-200\"><figure class=\"relative aspect-video overflow-hidden bg-base-300\"><img src=\"https://picsum.photos/seed/14236/600/340\" alt=\"Google may have a playful new name for the Pixel 11 Pro’s rear light\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover\" loading=\"lazy\"/><span class=\"absolute top-2 left-2 badge badge-md badge-prima