tent/60 line-clamp-3\">Apple’s CEO Hints That Heavy Use of Siri AI Could Cost You</p><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mt-2 text-sm text-base-content/50\"><span class=\"font-medium\">CNET</span><time dateTime=\"2026-07-31\">Yesterday</time></div></div></a><a href=\"https://arstechnica.com/science/2026/07/see-the-heat-an-infrared-imaging-system-that-outputs-in-color/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" class=\"card bg-base-200 border border-base-300 hover:border-primary transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 duration-200\"><figure class=\"relative aspect-video overflow-hidden bg-base-300\"><img src=\"https://picsum.photos/seed/4926/600/340\" alt=\"Researchers devise a full-color night vision goggle\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover\" loading=\"lazy\"/><span class=\"absolute top-2 left-2 badge badge-md badge-primary\">tech</span></figure><div class=\"card-body p-4 gap-2\"><h3 class=\"text-base font-semibold line-clamp-2 leading-snug\">Researchers devise a full-color night vision goggle</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-base-content/60 line-clamp-3\">Wavelength and intensity in the infrared are translated into colors in the visible.</p><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mt-2 text-sm text-base-content/50\"><span class=\"font-medium\">Ars Technica</span><time dateTime=\"2026-07-31\">Yesterday</time></div></div></a><a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/tech/973738/robot-vacuum-ban-fewer-choices-higher-prices\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" class=\"card bg-base-200 border border-base-300 hover:border-primary transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 duration-200\"><figure class=\"relative aspect-video overflow-hidden bg-base-300\"><img src=\"https://picsum.photos/seed/13557/600/340\" alt=\"The ban on robot vacuums won’t make them safer, only worse\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover\" loading=\"lazy\"/><span class=\"absolute top-2 left-2 badge badge-md badge-primary\">cameras</span></figure><div class=\"card-body p-4 gap-2\"><h3 class=\"t