16/600/340\" alt=\"Here’s an early look at Lenovo’s inaugural Googlebooks\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover\" loading=\"lazy\"/><span class=\"absolute top-2 left-2 badge badge-md badge-primary\">tech</span></figure><div class=\"card-body p-4 gap-2\"><h3 class=\"text-base font-semibold line-clamp-2 leading-snug\">Here’s an early look at Lenovo’s inaugural Googlebooks</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-base-content/60 line-clamp-3\">Tablets can be Googlebooks too, apparently.</p><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mt-2 text-sm text-base-content/50\"><span class=\"font-medium\">Android Authority</span><time dateTime=\"2026-07-31\">Yesterday</time></div></div></a><a href=\"https://www.androidauthority.com/xgimi-elfin-flip-laser-projector-deal-3693385/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" class=\"card bg-base-200 border border-base-300 hover:border-primary transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 duration-200\"><figure class=\"relative aspect-video overflow-hidden bg-base-300\"><img src=\"https://picsum.photos/seed/5633/600/340\" alt=\"The XGIMI Elfin Flip Laser projector is already 10% off at Amazon\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover\" loading=\"lazy\"/><span class=\"absolute top-2 left-2 badge badge-md badge-primary\">tech</span></figure><div class=\"card-body p-4 gap-2\"><h3 class=\"text-base font-semibold line-clamp-2 leading-snug\">The XGIMI Elfin Flip Laser projector is already 10% off at Amazon</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-base-content/60 line-clamp-3\">Amazon cut the Elfin Flip Laser to $718.99 in its first deal, with Netflix, triple-laser color, and a 150-degree stand.</p><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mt-2 text-sm text-base-content/50\"><span class=\"font-medium\">Android Authority</span><time dateTime=\"2026-07-31\">Yesterday</time></div></div></a><a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/07/31/apple-has-five-products-launching-this-fall-that-weve-waited-a-long-time-for/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" class=\"card bg-base-20