ss=\"text-sm text-base-content/60 line-clamp-3\">Apple made a big change to iPhone purchasing options this week. Not only did it launch the Apple Upgrade leasing program, but it also killed the iPhone Upgrade Program. With the iPhone 18 lineup just </p><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mt-2 text-sm text-base-content/50\"><span class=\"font-medium\">9to5Mac</span><time dateTime=\"2026-07-31\">Yesterday</time></div></div></a><a href=\"https://www.techradar.com/pro/security/c-suite-executives-need-to-upskill-themselves-to-really-understand-the-threats-ai-is-becoming-a-tool-for-attackers-and-defenders-but-true-resilience-requires-a-constantly-changing-strategy-says-former-gchq-intelligence-expert\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" class=\"card bg-base-200 border border-base-300 hover:border-primary transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 duration-200\"><figure class=\"relative aspect-video overflow-hidden bg-base-300\"><img src=\"https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/uFka7M2YjcFGhhtPTMDnJY-1280-80.jpg\" alt=\"&#x27;C-suite executives need to upskill themselves to really understand the threats&#x27;: AI is becoming a tool for attackers and defenders, but true resilience requires a constantly changing strategy, says former GCHQ intelligence expert\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover\" loading=\"lazy\"/><span class=\"absolute top-2 left-2 badge badge-md badge-primary\">tech</span></figure><div class=\"card-body p-4 gap-2\"><h3 class=\"text-base font-semibold line-clamp-2 leading-snug\">&#x27;C-suite executives need to upskill themselves to really understand the threats&#x27;: AI is becoming a tool for attackers and defenders, but true resilience requires a constantly changing strategy, says former GCHQ intelligence expert</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-base-content/60 line-clamp-3\">The only choice for businesses it to adapt and respond, and that means using an evolving resilience strategy.</p><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mt-2 text-sm text-base-content/50\"><span class=\"font-medium\">TechRadar</span><time dateTime=\"2026-07-31\">Yesterday</time></div></div></a><a href=\"https://www.androidauthority.com/samsung-galaxy-smarttag-3-leak-3693320/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" class=\"card bg-base-200 border border-base-300 hover:border-primary transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 duration-200\"><figure class=\"relative aspect-video overflow-hidden bg-base-300\"><img src=\"https://picsum.photos/seed/6296/600/340\" alt=\"Galaxy SmartTag 3 leak hints at a redesign with (no) strings attached\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover\" loading=\"lazy\"/><span class=\"absolute top-2 left-2 badge badge-md badge-primary\">mobiles</span></figure><div class=\"card-body p-4 gap-2\"><h3 class=\"text-base font-semibold line-clamp-2 leading-snug\">Galaxy SmartTag 3 leak hints at a redesign with (no) strings attached</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-base-content/60 line-clamp-3\">Your tracker now needs a tracker outfit.</p><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mt-2 text-sm text-base-content/50\"><span class=\"font-medium\">Android Authority</span><time dateTime=\"2026-07-31\">Yesterday</time></div></div></a><a href=\"https://arstechnica.com/security/2026/07/ai-scammers-outperform-humans-when-it-comes-to-building-trust/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" class=\"card bg-base-200 border border-base-300 hover:border-primary transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 duration-200\"><figure class=\"relative aspect-video overflow-hidden bg-base-300\"><img src=\"https://picsum.photos/seed/5885/600/340\" alt=\"AI scammers outperform humans when it comes to building trust\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover\" loading=\"lazy\"/><span class=\"absolute top-2 left-2 badge badge-md badge-primary\">tech</span></figure><div class=\"card-body p-4 gap-2\"><h3 class=\"text-base font-semibold line-clamp-2 leading-snug\">AI scammers outperform humans when it comes to building trust</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-base-content/60 line-clamp-3\">The AI chatbot was more effective at creating “exploitable trust” than the humans.</p><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mt-2 text-sm text-base-content/50\"><span class=\"font-medium\">Ars Technica</span><time dateTime=\"2026-07-31\">Yesterday</time></div></div></a><a href=\"https://9to5google.com/2026/07/31/review-galaxy-z-fold-8-ultra/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" class=\"card bg-base-200 border border-base-300 hover:border-primary transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 duration-200\"><figure class=\"relative aspect-video overflow-hidden bg-base-300\"><img src=\"https://picsum.photos/seed/15443/600/340\" alt=\"Review: The Galaxy Z Fold 8 Ultra ticks every box, but it’s the boring option now\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover\" loading=\"lazy\"/><span class=\"absolute top-2 left-2 badge badge-md badge-primary\">mobiles</span></figure><div class=\"card-body p-4 gap-2\"><h3 class=\"text-base font-semibold line-clamp-2 leading-snug\">Review: The Galaxy Z Fold 8 Ultra ticks every box, but it’s the boring option now</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-base-content/60 line-clamp-3\">Between two foldables – we can ignore the flippy one – the Galaxy Z Fold 8 Ultra positions itself as the specced out monster next to its little brother, the Galaxy Z Fold 8. But “specced out” comes wi</p><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mt-2 text-sm text-base-content/50\"><span class=\"font-medium\">9to5Google</span><time dateTime=\"2026-07-31\">Yesterday</time></div></div></a><a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/07/31/ios-27-gives-apple-mail-my-most-wished-for-feature-upgrade/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" class=\"card bg-base-200 border border-base-300 hover:border-primary transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 duration-200\"><figure class=\"relative aspect-video overflow-hidden bg-base-300\"><img src=\"https://picsum.photos/seed/5263/600/340\" alt=\"iOS 27 gives Apple Mail my most wished for feature upgrade\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover\" loading=\"lazy\"/><span class=\"absolute top-2 left-2 badge badge-md badge-primary\">mobiles</span></figure><div class=\"card-body p-4 gap-2\"><h3 class=\"text-base font-semibold line-clamp-2 leading-snug\">iOS 27 gives Apple Mail my most wished for feature upgrade</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-base-content/60 line-clamp-3\">Apple’s Mail app in iOS 27 promises to offer the feature upgrade that’s been at the top of my wishlist for years: search that “just works.”</p><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mt-2 text-sm text-base-content/50\"><span class=\"font-medium\">9to5Mac</span><time dateTime=\"2026-07-31\">Yesterday</time></div></div></a><a href=\"https://www.techradar.com/pro/why-traditional-security-checks-are-failing-in-the-age-of-ai-driven-fraud\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" class=\"card bg-base-200 border border-base-300 hover:border-primary transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 duration-200\"><figure class=\"relative aspect-video overflow-hidden bg-base-300\"><img src=\"https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/x4SmwpYXk8yGgDmYCVeckL-1280-80.jpg\" alt=\"Why traditional security checks are failing in the age of AI-driven fraud\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover\" loading=\"lazy\"/><span class=\"absolute top-2 left-2 badge badge-md badge-primary\">tech</span></figure><div class=\"card-body p-4 gap-2\"><h3 class=\"text-base font-semibold line-clamp-2 leading-snug\">Why traditional security checks are failing in the age of AI-driven fraud</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-base-content/60 line-clamp-3\">As AI supercharges fraud with deepfakes and synthetic identities, continuous, layered defenses are now essential.</p><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mt-2 text-sm text-base-content/50\"><span class=\"font-medium\">TechRadar</span><time dateTime=\"2026-07-31\">Yesterday</time></div></div></a><a href=\"https://www.techradar.com/pro/the-surge-in-ai-driven-fraud-requires-coordinated-global-defense\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" class=\"card bg-base-200 border border-base-300 hover:border-primary transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 duration-200\"><figure class=\"relative aspect-video overflow-hidden bg-base-300\"><img src=\"https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/5RYCUPY3MrRkUECQECzDC-1280-80.jpg\" alt=\"The surge in AI-driven fraud requires coordinated global defense\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover\" loading=\"lazy\"/><span class=\"absolute top-2 left-2 badge badge-md badge-primary\">routers</span></figure><div class=\"card-body p-4 gap-2\"><h3 class=\"text-base font-semibold line-clamp-2 leading-snug\">The surge in AI-driven fraud requires coordinated global defense</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-base-content/60 line-clamp-3\">AI has enabled an 8,000% fraud surge, and a global networked response is our best bet to stop it.</p><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mt-2 text-sm text-base-content/50\"><span class=\"font-medium\">TechRadar</span><time dateTime=\"2026-07-31\">Yesterday</time></div></div></a><a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/07/31/iphone-18-pro-may-launch-at-1399-starting-price-per-report/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" class=\"card bg-base-200 border border-base-300 hover:border-primary transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 duration-200\"><figure class=\"relative aspect-video overflow-hidden bg-base-300\"><img src=\"https://picsum.photos/seed/5256/600/340\" alt=\"iPhone 18 Pro may launch at $1,399 starting price, per report\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover\" loading=\"lazy\"/><span class=\"absolute top-2 left-2 badge badge-md badge-primary\">mobiles</span></figure><div class=\"card-body p-4 gap-2\"><h3 class=\"text-base font-semibold line-clamp-2 leading-snug\">iPhone 18 Pro may launch at $1,399 starting price, per report</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-base-content/60 line-clamp-3\">iPhone 18 Pro is coming very soon, and it might cost much more than its predecessor, with a second report now predicting a starting price around $1,399.</p><div