 so I will\",\"date\":\"2026-08-01\",\"dateLabel\":\"Today\",\"tag\":\"auto\",\"url\":\"https://www.xda-developers.com/windows-has-been-quietly-wearing-out-your-ssd-and-the-fix-takes-one-setting/\",\"source\":\"XDA Developers\",\"image\":\"https://static0.xdaimages.com/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/wm/2026/07/crucial-ssd-desktop.jpg\"},{\"id\":\"n1678296939\",\"title\":\"Gemini will create mobile & desktop apps in the future as AI Studio for Android, iOS is canceled\",\"excerpt\":\"At I/O 2026, Google teased an AI Studio app for Android and iOS. This mobile application has been canceled in favor of what sounds like a deep Gemini app integration.\",\"date\":\"2026-07-31\",\"dateLabel\":\"Today\",\"tag\":\"mobiles\",\"url\":\"https://9to5google.com/2026/07/31/gemini-ai-studio-app/\",\"source\":\"9to5Google\",\"image\":\"https://picsum.photos/seed/8804/600/340\"},{\"id\":\"n1881008189\",\"title\":\"AMD promised AM5 support until 2029, and the memory crisis might not let it stop there\",\"excerpt\":\"AM5 is now the past, present, and apparently, the future for consumer PCs\",\"date\":\"2026-07-31\",\"dateLabel\":\"Today\",\"tag\":\"tech\",\"url\":\"https://www.xda-developers.com/amd-promised-am5-support-until-2029-and-the-memory-crisis-might-not-let-it-stop-there/\",\"source\":\"XDA Developers\",\"image\":\"https://static0.xdaimages.com/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/wm/2024/11/amd-ryzen-7-9800x3d-installed.jpg\"},{\"id\":\"n1259912391\",\"title\":\"Grab 1.54TB free cloud storage for life — but you will need to sign up to 43 services\",\"excerpt\":\"No strings attached, but you will need to subscribe to and maintain more than 40 services.\",\"date\":\"2026-07-31\",\"dateLabel\":\"Today\",\"tag\":\"tech\",\"url\":\"https://www.techradar.com/pro/grab-1-54tb-free-cloud-storage-for-life-but-you-will-need-to-sign-up-43-services\",\"source\":\"TechRadar\",\"image\":\"https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/E4uAqGFTRWwta845DHU8z9-1280-80.jpg\"},{\"id\":\"n1896865042\",\"title\":\"NYT S