-confirms-ukraines-drones-will-reach-6-000-miles-in-2027-enough-to-cover-the-entirety-of-russia-and-able-to-reach-as-far-as-san-francisco-from-kyiv\",\"source\":\"TechRadar\",\"image\":\"https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/rpDiL2aBWBfnfUJ6QVXfnd-1280-80.png\"},{\"id\":\"n379353616\",\"title\":\"Windows has been quietly wearing out your SSD, and the fix takes one setting\",\"excerpt\":\"Microsoft wouldn't take care of my storage, so I will\",\"date\":\"2026-08-01\",\"dateLabel\":\"Today\",\"tag\":\"auto\",\"url\":\"https://www.xda-developers.com/windows-has-been-quietly-wearing-out-your-ssd-and-the-fix-takes-one-setting/\",\"source\":\"XDA Developers\",\"image\":\"https://static0.xdaimages.com/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/wm/2026/07/crucial-ssd-desktop.jpg\"},{\"id\":\"n1678296939\",\"title\":\"Gemini will create mobile & desktop apps in the future as AI Studio for Android, iOS is canceled\",\"excerpt\":\"At I/O 2026, Google teased an AI Studio app for Android and iOS. This mobile application has been canceled in favor of what sounds like a deep Gemini app integration.\",\"date\":\"2026-07-31\",\"dateLabel\":\"Today\",\"tag\":\"mobiles\",\"url\":\"https://9to5google.com/2026/07/31/gemini-ai-studio-app/\",\"source\":\"9to5Google\",\"image\":\"https://picsum.photos/seed/8804/600/340\"},{\"id\":\"n1881008189\",\"title\":\"AMD promised AM5 support until 2029, and the memory crisis might not let it stop there\",\"excerpt\":\"AM5 is now the past, present, and apparently, the future for consumer PCs\",\"date\":\"2026-07-31\",\"dateLabel\":\"Today\",\"tag\":\"tech\",\"url\":\"https://www.xda-developers.com/amd-promised-am5-support-until-2029-and-the-memory-crisis-might-not-let-it-stop-there/\",\"source\":\"XDA Developers\",\"image\":\"https://static0.xdaimages.com/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/wm/2024/11/amd-ryzen-7-9800x3d-installed.jpg\"},{\"id\":\"n1259912391\",\"title\":\"Grab 1.54TB free cloud storage for life — but you will need to sign up to 43 services\",\"excerpt\":\"N